  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Someday You'll Call My Name**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Think of What You've Done**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Riding the Midnight Train**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2022-11-30** (recommended): source not stated; 26 songs; 150 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2022-11-30**: taped by TW; transferred by TW; source: ca14->ca9100->sony pcm-m10 [1]. Also: Recorded with a chain starting at ca14 microphones into ca9100, captured on a Sony PCM-M10 as 48 kHz, 24-bit WAV; Transfer went from the recorder to hard drive, edited in CEP, converted to 44.1 kHz, 16-bit, then FLAC [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Vega - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/vega/) [3]\n- Poster by tdk-c90.blogspot.com: [2022-11-30 - Billy Strings - Copenhagen Vega, DK](https://tdk-c90.blogspot.com/2022/12/2022-11-30-billy-strings-copenhagen.html) [4]",
